  "description": "School, work, home—there are lots of places to play!\nEnjoy the thrill as you try not to get caught!\nUp to 6 players can join in the fun with a Joy-Con™ for each player!\nWatch for the perfect timing to earn as many points as possible!\n\n《Roles》\n・Actor\n  Play to earn points and try not to get caught!\n  Play at a sparkling location to earn even more points!\n\n・Watcher\n  Find people playing to earn points!\n\n[Time Attack]\nAim for the fastest clear possible and climb the rankings!\nPlay without getting caught and try to reduce your time!\n\n[Battle]\nCompete for the highest score against friends and CPUs!\nPlay skillfully to earn the most points!\n\n[Online Mode]\nPlay in real time against players around the world!\nUp to 4 people can play at a time!\n\nIn friendly and online matches, the roles are decided randomly!\nFinding out which role you'll be is part of the fun!",
